						enabled = "[GetScriptedGui('te_tax_cmd_package_reschedule_sgui').IsValid( GuiScope.SetRoot( GetPlayer.MakeScope ).AddScope( 'op', MakeScopeValue( '(CFixedPoint)2' ) ).End )]"
						onclick = "[GetScriptedGui('te_tax_cmd_package_reschedule_sgui').Execute( GuiScope.SetRoot( GetPlayer.MakeScope ).AddScope( 'op', MakeScopeValue( '(CFixedPoint)2' ) ).End )]"
						tooltip = "[Concatenate( GetScriptedGui('te_tax_cmd_package_reschedule_sgui').IsValidTooltip( GuiScope.SetRoot( GetPlayer.MakeScope ).AddScope( 'op', MakeScopeValue( '(CFixedPoint)2' ) ).End ), Concatenate( Localize( 'te_tt_break' ), GetScriptedGui('te_tax_cmd_package_reschedule_sgui').ExecuteTooltip( GuiScope.SetRoot( GetPlayer.MakeScope ).AddScope( 'op', MakeScopeValue( '(CFixedPoint)2' ) ).End ) ) )]"
					}
					button = {
						using = default_button
						using = te_tax_fontsize_row
						size = { 237 32 }
						text = "te_tax_pk_release"
						enabled = "[GetScriptedGui('te_tax_cmd_package_release_sgui').IsValid( GuiScope.SetRoot( GetPlayer.MakeScope ).AddScope( 'op', MakeScopeValue( '(CFixedPoint)2' ) ).End )]"
						onclick = "[GetScriptedGui('te_tax_cmd_package_release_sgui').Execute( GuiScope.SetRoot( GetPlayer.MakeScope ).AddScope( 'op', MakeScopeValue( '(CFixedPoint)2' ) ).End )]"
						tooltip = "[Concatenate( GetScriptedGui('te_tax_cmd_package_release_sgui').IsValidTooltip( GuiScope.SetRoot( GetPlayer.MakeScope ).AddScope( 'op', MakeScopeValue( '(CFixedPoint)2' ) ).End ), Concatenate( Localize( 'te_tt_break' ), GetScriptedGui('te_tax_cmd_package_release_sgui').ExecuteTooltip( GuiScope.SetRoot( GetPlayer.MakeScope ).AddScope( 'op', MakeScopeValue( '(CFixedPoint)2' ) ).End ) ) )]"
					}
				}
			}
		}
	}

	### ======================================================================
	### PROMISES (open while one is pending or binding; plan Task 12)
	### ======================================================================
	### One row per obligation slot, shown while the slot is on: pending on the
	### bill under debate, bound to a passed bill, being delivered or being
	### kept. Renegotiate (te_tax_cmd_obl_renegotiate_sgui, op = the slot) only
	### once it is in force (state 2 or 3): a pending one changes with the bill,
	### and a bound one lapses only with its package. Kept, broken and renegotiated promises leave their row and go to
	### the history.
	type te_tax_obligations_section = flowcontainer {
		direction = vertical
		parentanchor = hcenter
		ignoreinvisible = yes
		spacing = 2
		visible = "[GetScriptedGui('te_tax_show_obligations_sgui').IsShown( GuiScope.SetRoot( GetPlayer.MakeScope ).End )]"

		te_tax_section_header = {
			blockoverride "left_text" {
				text = "te_tax_obl_header"
			}
			blockoverride "onclick" {
				onclick = "[GetVariableSystem.Toggle('te_tax_obligations_closed')]"
			}
			blockoverride "onclick_showmore" {
				visible = "[GetVariableSystem.Exists('te_tax_obligations_closed')]"
			}
			blockoverride "onclick_showless" {
				visible = "[Not(GetVariableSystem.Exists('te_tax_obligations_closed'))]"
			}
		}

		te_tax_panel = {
			visible = "[Not(GetVariableSystem.Exists('te_tax_obligations_closed'))]"

			te_tax_obligation_row = {
				visible = "[NotEqualTo_CFixedPoint( GetPlayer.MakeScope.ScriptValue('te_tax_view_o1_on'), '(CFixedPoint)0' )]"
				blockoverride "obl_ig" {
					text = "[GetPlayer.GetCustom('te_tax_obl_ig_1')]"
				}
				blockoverride "obl_what" {
					text = "[GetPlayer.GetCustom('te_tax_obl_mode_1')] [GetPlayer.GetCustom('te_tax_obl_what_1')]"
				}
				blockoverride "obl_state" {
					text = "[GetPlayer.GetCustom('te_tax_obl_state_1')]"
				}
				blockoverride "obl_renegotiate" {
					visible = "[Or( EqualTo_CFixedPoint( GetPlayer.MakeScope.ScriptValue('te_tax_view_o1_state'), '(CFixedPoint)2' ), EqualTo_CFixedPoint( GetPlayer.MakeScope.ScriptValue('te_tax_view_o1_state'), '(CFixedPoint)3' ) )]"
					enabled = "[GetScriptedGui('te_tax_cmd_obl_renegotiate_sgui').IsValid( GuiScope.SetRoot( GetPlayer.MakeScope ).AddScope( 'op', MakeScopeValue( '(CFixedPoint)1' ) ).End )]"
					onclick = "[GetScriptedGui('te_tax_cmd_obl_renegotiate_sgui').Execute( GuiScope.SetRoot( GetPlayer.MakeScope ).AddScope( 'op', MakeScopeValue( '(CFixedPoint)1' ) ).End )]"
					tooltip = "[Concatenate( GetScriptedGui('te_tax_cmd_obl_renegotiate_sgui').IsValidTooltip( GuiScope.SetRoot( GetPlayer.MakeScope ).AddScope( 'op', MakeScopeValue( '(CFixedPoint)1' ) ).End ), Concatenate( Localize( 'te_tt_break' ), GetScriptedGui('te_tax_cmd_obl_renegotiate_sgui').ExecuteTooltip( GuiScope.SetRoot( GetPlayer.MakeScope ).AddScope( 'op', MakeScopeValue( '(CFixedPoint)1' ) ).End ) ) )]"
				}
			}
			te_tax_obligation_row = {
				visible = "[NotEqualTo_CFixedPoint( GetPlayer.MakeScope.ScriptValue('te_tax_view_o2_on'), '(CFixedPoint)0' )]"
				blockoverride "obl_ig" {
					text = "[GetPlayer.GetCustom('te_tax_obl_ig_2')]"
				}
				blockoverride "obl_what" {
					text = "[GetPlayer.GetCustom('te_tax_obl_mode_2')] [GetPlayer.GetCustom('te_tax_obl_what_2')]"
				}
				blockoverride "obl_state" {
					text = "[GetPlayer.GetCustom('te_tax_obl_state_2')]"
				}
				blockoverride "obl_renegotiate" {
					visible = "[Or( EqualTo_CFixedPoint( GetPlayer.MakeScope.ScriptValue('te_tax_view_o2_state'), '(CFixedPoint)2' ), EqualTo_CFixedPoint( GetPlayer.MakeScope.ScriptValue('te_tax_view_o2_state'), '(CFixedPoint)3' ) )]"
					enabled = "[GetScriptedGui('te_tax_cmd_obl_renegotiate_sgui').IsValid( GuiScope.SetRoot( GetPlayer.MakeScope ).AddScope( 'op', MakeScopeValue( '(CFixedPoint)2' ) ).End )]"
					onclick = "[GetScriptedGui('te_tax_cmd_obl_renegotiate_sgui').Execute( GuiScope.SetRoot( GetPlayer.MakeScope ).AddScope( 'op', MakeScopeValue( '(CFixedPoint)2' ) ).End )]"
					tooltip = "[Concatenate( GetScriptedGui('te_tax_cmd_obl_renegotiate_sgui').IsValidTooltip( GuiScope.SetRoot( GetPlayer.MakeScope ).AddScope( 'op', MakeScopeValue( '(CFixedPoint)2' ) ).End ), Concatenate( Localize( 'te_tt_break' ), GetScriptedGui('te_tax_cmd_obl_renegotiate_sgui').ExecuteTooltip( GuiScope.SetRoot( GetPlayer.MakeScope ).AddScope( 'op', MakeScopeValue( '(CFixedPoint)2' ) ).End ) ) )]"
				}
			}
			te_tax_obligation_row = {
				visible = "[NotEqualTo_CFixedPoint( GetPlayer.MakeScope.ScriptValue('te_tax_view_o3_on'), '(CFixedPoint)0' )]"
				blockoverride "obl_ig" {
					text = "[GetPlayer.GetCustom('te_tax_obl_ig_3')]"
				}
				blockoverride "obl_what" {
					text = "[GetPlayer.GetCustom('te_tax_obl_mode_3')] [GetPlayer.GetCustom('te_tax_obl_what_3')]"
				}
				blockoverride "obl_state" {
					text = "[GetPlayer.GetCustom('te_tax_obl_state_3')]"
				}
				blockoverride "obl_renegotiate" {
					visible = "[Or( EqualTo_CFixedPoint( GetPlayer.MakeScope.ScriptValue('te_tax_view_o3_state'), '(CFixedPoint)2' ), EqualTo_CFixedPoint( GetPlayer.MakeScope.ScriptValue('te_tax_view_o3_state'), '(CFixedPoint)3' ) )]"
					enabled = "[GetScriptedGui('te_tax_cmd_obl_renegotiate_sgui').IsValid( GuiScope.SetRoot( GetPlayer.MakeScope ).AddScope( 'op', MakeScopeValue( '(CFixedPoint)3' ) ).End )]"
					onclick = "[GetScriptedGui('te_tax_cmd_obl_renegotiate_sgui').Execute( GuiScope.SetRoot( GetPlayer.MakeScope ).AddScope( 'op', MakeScopeValue( '(CFixedPoint)3' ) ).End )]"
					tooltip = "[Concatenate( GetScriptedGui('te_tax_cmd_obl_renegotiate_sgui').IsValidTooltip( GuiScope.SetRoot( GetPlayer.MakeScope ).AddScope( 'op', MakeScopeValue( '(CFixedPoint)3' ) ).End ), Concatenate( Localize( 'te_tt_break' ), GetScriptedGui('te_tax_cmd_obl_renegotiate_sgui').ExecuteTooltip( GuiScope.SetRoot( GetPlayer.MakeScope ).AddScope( 'op', MakeScopeValue( '(CFixedPoint)3' ) ).End ) ) )]"
				}
			}
			te_tax_obligation_row = {
				visible = "[NotEqualTo_CFixedPoint( GetPlayer.MakeScope.ScriptValue('te_tax_view_o4_on'), '(CFixedPoint)0' )]"
				blockoverride "obl_ig" {
					text = "[GetPlayer.GetCustom('te_tax_obl_ig_4')]"
				}
				blockoverride "obl_what" {
					text = "[GetPlayer.GetCustom('te_tax_obl_mode_4')] [GetPlayer.GetCustom('te_tax_obl_what_4')]"
				}
				blockoverride "obl_state" {
					text = "[GetPlayer.GetCustom('te_tax_obl_state_4')]"
				}
				blockoverride "obl_renegotiate" {
					visible = "[Or( EqualTo_CFixedPoint( GetPlayer.MakeScope.ScriptValue('te_tax_view_o4_state'), '(CFixedPoint)2' ), EqualTo_CFixedPoint( GetPlayer.MakeScope.ScriptValue('te_tax_view_o4_state'), '(CFixedPoint)3' ) )]"
					enabled = "[GetScriptedGui('te_tax_cmd_obl_renegotiate_sgui').IsValid( GuiScope.SetRoot( GetPlayer.MakeScope ).AddScope( 'op', MakeScopeValue( '(CFixedPoint)4' ) ).End )]"
					onclick = "[GetScriptedGui('te_tax_cmd_obl_renegotiate_sgui').Execute( GuiScope.SetRoot( GetPlayer.MakeScope ).AddScope( 'op', MakeScopeValue( '(CFixedPoint)4' ) ).End )]"
					tooltip = "[Concatenate( GetScriptedGui('te_tax_cmd_obl_renegotiate_sgui').IsValidTooltip( GuiScope.SetRoot( GetPlayer.MakeScope ).AddScope( 'op', MakeScopeValue( '(CFixedPoint)4' ) ).End ), Concatenate( Localize( 'te_tt_break' ), GetScriptedGui('te_tax_cmd_obl_renegotiate_sgui').ExecuteTooltip( GuiScope.SetRoot( GetPlayer.MakeScope ).AddScope( 'op', MakeScopeValue( '(CFixedPoint)4' ) ).End ) ) )]"
				}
			}
		}
	}
}
